---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
import BackButton from '../components/BackButton.astro';
import { mediaUrl } from '../lib/media';
import '../styles/site.css';
import '../styles/site/poems.css';
---

<BaseLayout title="Poem">
  <BackButton label="Back" fallback="/" />

  <div class="container0">
    <div class="bilderleft">
      <img src={mediaUrl('site/poems/tuzi/tuzi.jpg')} alt="Rabbit illustration" title="tuzi" />
    </div>

    <div class="poem0">
      <div class="header"><h3><i>Secret A</i></h3></div>
      <div class="body">
        <p class="content">
          World divided in random blocks, <br />
          Since the end of September,<br />
          we've been in a div amount countless divs. <br /><br />
          I and you are accidentally inlined,<br /> in a class called athletic verse.
          <br /><br />
          In the context of flex, <br />
          we are centered and highlighted. <br />
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="poem1">
      <div class="header"><h3><i>Secret B</i></h3></div>
      <div class="body">
        <p class="content">
          Rocks, giant trees. <br /><br />
          A silky tone, <br />a dark tune. <br /> <br />
          Interwoven branches, <br />
          Interwoven desires, <br />whatever solid and liquid.<br /><br />
          Rich and dense emotions,<br />
          A touch of love, an infinete ocean.<br />
          Dim yet sparkling,<br /> bright yet mutable.<br /><br />
          A deepest joy from a deepest melancholy.<br /><br />
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="poem2">
      <div class="header"><h3><i>Normal</i></h3></div>
      <div class="body">
        <p class="content">
          I have normal cells and normal blood, <br /><br />
          normal veins and normal stomach.<br /><br />
          Normal brains and normal voice.<br /><br />
          Normal legs and normal thoughts.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container3">
    <div class="poem6">
      <div class="header"><h3><i>Reminiscence</i></h3></div>
      <div class="body">
        <p class="content">
          Reminiscence of vanished homeland.<br /><br />
          Smell of soils, mountains, <br />salty water and air.<br /><br />
          Chanting birds, <br />whirled winds above sea,<br />
          undulating waves.<br />
          Outline of a seagull, yelling sailors.<br />
          Endless blue, vast and vague.<br /><br />
          Teeming bottles and glasses on the table,<br />
          wood and warm.<br />
          Our old glory days.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="poem7">
      <div class="header"><h3><i>Snowy night</i></h3></div>
      <div class="body">
        <p class="content">
          Why did the soil turn to milky white?<br />
          She must be gentle and introvert,<br />
          the same as I.<br /><br />
          Tranquility in me or you, or woman,<br />
          material or immaterial,<br />
          known or unknown.<br /><br />
          Soundless surrounding,<br />
          but the bell of the coming tram.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
